WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.475
- I feel like Lex Luther when I do this.

00:00:01.475 --> 00:00:04.114
This must be what he
does, his morning ritual.

00:00:04.114 --> 00:00:05.055
Every day.

00:00:05.055 --> 00:00:07.552
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.552 --> 00:00:09.289
- I've gotten close.

00:00:09.289 --> 00:00:10.241
I've buzzed down to like a one or a two

00:00:10.241 --> 00:00:11.935
every once in a while, you
know, I tease it a little bit.

00:00:11.935 --> 00:00:13.413
But no, I've never shaved
my head all the way.

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:14.336
- All of a sudden you wake up

00:00:14.336 --> 00:00:16.166
and that widow's peak that I used to have

00:00:16.166 --> 00:00:18.094
now kinda started going backwards.

00:00:18.094 --> 00:00:20.202
- I didn't want to believe
that I was losing my hair.

00:00:20.202 --> 00:00:22.223
So you kinda ignore it for a while.

00:00:22.223 --> 00:00:23.175
- Started at the age of 20.

00:00:23.175 --> 00:00:24.755
At 20 you're supposed to
have a full head of hair.

00:00:24.755 --> 00:00:26.064
- Soon as it starts to happen to you,

00:00:26.064 --> 00:00:28.037
you start to think about these things.

00:00:28.037 --> 00:00:29.644
- You definitely go through
that self conscious stage

00:00:29.644 --> 00:00:31.235
where you're trying to hide it.

00:00:31.235 --> 00:00:33.030
- I am balding. I can't be balding.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:33.984
I look older.

00:00:33.984 --> 00:00:35.262
- People are gonna think
differently of me now

00:00:35.262 --> 00:00:36.305
because of this.

00:00:36.305 --> 00:00:37.571
- I might as well just bite the bullet

00:00:37.571 --> 00:00:39.261
and see what I look like all the way bald.

00:00:39.261 --> 00:00:41.003
People has said I probably
have a good head for it.

00:00:41.003 --> 00:00:44.782
- Sometimes going bald can
look pretty sexy, so...

00:00:44.782 --> 00:00:46.519
- I really hope that I will look good.

00:00:46.519 --> 00:00:48.116
You know some people have the head for it,

00:00:48.116 --> 00:00:50.162
other people do not, and you
don't necessarily find that out

00:00:50.162 --> 00:00:52.252
until you've gone there.

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:53.730
- Yeah let's shave this head.

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:54.653
- Yeah let's try it.

00:00:54.653 --> 00:00:56.313
- Shave it off.

00:00:56.313 --> 00:00:57.863
(heavy metal music)

00:00:57.863 --> 00:00:58.696
Here goes nothing.

00:00:58.696 --> 00:01:00.675
(electric razor)

00:01:00.675 --> 00:01:02.178
- I've never seen myself as a bald head.

00:01:02.178 --> 00:01:03.812
- Getting rained on by my own hair.

00:01:03.812 --> 00:01:05.999
- That was a big chunk of
hair that just fell off.

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:08.119
- I really don't know why
I've never done this before.

00:01:08.119 --> 00:01:09.166
- Am I good?

00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:10.901
- I think that now it's time to go full.

00:01:10.901 --> 00:01:12.937
- Alright let's do this.

00:01:12.937 --> 00:01:15.265
- The instruction manual said
that we have to have this.

00:01:15.265 --> 00:01:16.566
- I'm just gonna go overboard.

00:01:16.566 --> 00:01:19.020
- I'm really excited
to see how this looks.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:21.687
- Alright, moment of truth here.

00:01:24.783 --> 00:01:26.316
- We'll see about my girlfriend.

00:01:26.316 --> 00:01:28.041
She might not like it as much.

00:01:28.041 --> 00:01:28.980
- I'm kinda sold on this already.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:30.560
I haven't seen it yet, but it feels dope.

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:31.883
- This is a weird feeling.

00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:34.013
- My head is not used to being shaved.

00:01:34.013 --> 00:01:35.537
- It's just my skin.

00:01:35.537 --> 00:01:38.537
(upbeat folk music)

00:01:40.421 --> 00:01:42.532
- Oh yeah that's definitely bald.

00:01:42.532 --> 00:01:43.865
- Ohh shhhhh....

00:01:45.579 --> 00:01:47.238
- I like it, wow.

00:01:47.238 --> 00:01:48.280
(laughing)

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:50.418
- I guess it plays to the evilness.

00:01:50.418 --> 00:01:51.501
Maybe, maybe.

00:01:52.754 --> 00:01:54.297
- Definitely interesting
thing to get used to,

00:01:54.297 --> 00:01:55.536
seeing yourself with no hair.

00:01:55.536 --> 00:01:57.169
- I just saved a lot of money on haircuts.

00:01:57.169 --> 00:01:58.431
- I can feel the breeze.

00:01:58.431 --> 00:01:59.564
If there was a breeze in here.

00:01:59.564 --> 00:02:01.058
- I think this is
something I could do again.

00:02:01.058 --> 00:02:03.038
- I like the shape of my head fortunately.

00:02:03.038 --> 00:02:04.204
- Whether or not I like it,

00:02:04.204 --> 00:02:07.307
it's definitely easier than
trying to combat going bald.

00:02:07.307 --> 00:02:08.721
- If I saw myself on the street,

00:02:08.721 --> 00:02:10.839
I would think wow that guy
has a lot of confidence,

00:02:10.839 --> 00:02:12.631
just to shave all his hair off like that.

00:02:12.631 --> 00:02:15.578
And not care necessarily
what people think.

00:02:15.578 --> 00:02:17.422
- I don't care if I am bald, long hair,

00:02:17.422 --> 00:02:19.354
short hair, totally bald, half bald,

00:02:19.354 --> 00:02:22.065
it doesn't matter to me because
I'm always true to myself.

00:02:22.065 --> 00:02:25.710
And that's kind of why
I don't mind this look.

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:28.627
I like to think I'm true to myself.

